@startuml
title Smart Credit — client_db (основные таблицы и связи)
hide circle
hide methods
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam entity {
  BackgroundColor #F4F8FD
  BorderColor #55708D
  FontColor #172234
}

entity companies {
  * org_id : UUID <<PK, external auth_db>>
  --
  * inn : TEXT
  * version : BIGINT
}
entity products {
  * id : UUID <<PK>>
  --
  * version : BIGINT
  * code : TEXT <<UNIQUE>>
  * requirements_policy_version : TEXT
}
entity applications {
  * id : UUID <<PK, = bank cases.id>>
  --
  * org_id : UUID <<FK>>
  * product_id : UUID <<snapshot, no FK>>
  * status : TEXT
  pending_action : TEXT
  * version : BIGINT
  * client_event_version : BIGINT
  * bank_event_version : BIGINT
}
entity application_documents {
  * id : UUID <<PK>>
  --
  * application_id : UUID <<FK>>
  * storage_key : TEXT <<UNIQUE>>
  * sha256 : TEXT
}
entity info_requests {
  * id : UUID <<PK>>
  --
  * application_id : UUID <<FK>>
  * is_active : BOOLEAN
}
entity offers {
  * id : UUID <<PK>>
  --
  * application_id : UUID <<FK>>
  * kind : TEXT
  * expires_at : TIMESTAMPTZ
}
entity timeline_entries {
  * id : UUID <<PK>>
  --
  * application_id : UUID <<FK>>
  * status : TEXT
}
entity outbox {
  * event_id : UUID <<PK>>
  --
  * aggregate_id : UUID <<FK>>
  * aggregate_version : BIGINT
  * topic : TEXT <<client.events>>
}

companies ||--o{ applications : org_id
applications ||--o{ application_documents
applications ||--o{ info_requests
applications ||--o{ offers
applications ||--o{ timeline_entries
applications ||--o{ outbox : aggregate_id
products .. applications : product snapshot, no FK

legend bottom
Сплошная связь — FK внутри client_db; пунктир — логическая связь без FK.
outbox публикует client.events; processed_events дедуплицирует bank.events.
Служебные processed_events и idempotency_keys опущены для читаемости.
Оригиналы документов лежат в Docker volume client_documents.
Полный состав колонок — в миграциях client-service.
endlegend
@enduml
